# Test of Witchcraft (Q229), the letters and the sword: Orim sends the traveller off with the instructions and
# two letters (cond 6); Vasper gives the letter for Vadin; Vadin the crucifix, and, with 20 amulets (19 held,
# the last from a Tamlin orc), the sanctions; Vasper the Sword of Binding; Iker the soultrap crystal; Orim
# sends the traveller to Evert. Orim's and Evert's Zeruels are script-spawned and are not reachable in a
# scenario: the Boot tests play them.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
